{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acornia of The Stars is a fast paced retro inspired 3D platformer where you must sprint, jump and homing attack\u00a0your way through the different worlds that you encounter along your quest to save Acorn kind!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auri and the Acorn folks\u2019 home planet is destroyed in a catastrophic asteroid strike. This strike sends a small chunk of their home world into orbit around the center of the universe, however this chunk is slowly dying so the Acorn folk must try and request the other Acorns to restore this piece of his world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They must collect enough of the Acorn folk in each nearby planet in order to get the acorn power they need to restore the world\u00a0<strong><i>are you up for the task of saving Acorn kind?</i></strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3572080?t=1771221162","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3572080?t=1771221162","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572080/bc609fe66b21c817fe236fb2e9c3c9e953cc36b6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771221162","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572080/bc609fe66b21c817fe236fb2e9c3c9e953cc36b6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771221162","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3797000,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acornia of The Stars is a fast paced retro inspired 3D platformer where you must sprint, jump and homing attack\u00a0your way through the different worlds that you encounter along your quest to save Acorn kind!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_pa